cnee -record -events-to-record 1000 -mouse -keyboard -o /tmp/xnee.xns -e
/tmp/xnee.log -v Records 1000 events (keyboard and mouse) to file
/tmp/xnee.xns and dumps the verbose printout to /tmp/xnee.log

   cnee -replay -f /tmp/xnee.xns -v -e /tmp/xnee.log -ns Read data from
/tmp/xnee.xns, replay it and verbose print to file /tmp/xnee.log

   For more examples, read the Xnee manual


